INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (206, 'task', 'TASK-0055-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed f8b30a0 on roadmap/r8-workflow-rules (not pushed). LIFECYCLE_RULES off/warn/enforce, default warn, unknown value falls back to warn and logs; BaseHandler._rule_warnings turns reasons into warnings or a StatusRefused before any write; StatusChange carries them into the text and structuredContent, per task for list moves. First rule: starting or completing a task with dependencies that are not Complete names them, and names abandoned ones separately with the two ways out. 286 passed (coverage 70.3%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 00:34:44', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (207, 'task', 'TASK-0056-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 2291d74 on roadmap/r8-workflow-rules (not pushed). Completing a task with subtasks that are neither Complete nor Abandoned names them; completing a task that was never started or is still Blocked says so; reopening a Complete task says so. No other task move is flagged. Same helper, so enforce refuses and warn reports. 289 passed (coverage 70.4%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 00:37:19', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (208, 'task', 'TASK-0057-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 8f0ce1d on roadmap/r8-workflow-rules (not pushed). A requirement reaching Implemented with open tasks names them, and obeys the mode; the Validated gate stays always on, including with off. ADR moves outside their vocabulary say where that status usually goes (ADR statuses and the TDD chain kept separate); R9''s Superseded link rule still applies in every mode. 292 passed (coverage 70.6%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 00:39:51', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (209, 'task', 'TASK-0058-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 8d9cfca on roadmap/r8-workflow-rules (not pushed). The dashboard separates unfinished from abandoned dependencies: abandoned ones get their own line saying to drop the link or abandon the task too, and structuredContent carries abandoned_dependencies only when there are any; a waiting task''s details say the same under Depends On. 294 passed (coverage 70.7%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 00:41:51', 0);
