INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (221, 'task', 'TASK-0060-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed e4f6230 on roadmap/r13-diagrams (not pushed). full_project draws every non-deprecated record with labelled edges for requirement-implements-task, requirement-addresses-ADR, task-implements-ADR and ADR-supersedes-ADR; the 10/10/5 record caps and the 20-edge cap are gone; edges only when both ends are drawn; deprecated records left out and counted in the response; labels keep 60 characters and escape mermaid punctuation. 304 passed (coverage 70.9%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:21:35', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (222, 'task', 'TASK-0061-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed c1ba777 on roadmap/r13-diagrams (not pushed). Architecture diagram draws supersedes edges and the requirements each decision addresses; requirements diagram keeps type grouping and adds parent/depends edges; tasks diagram labels subtask edges and adds dependency and blocks edges; dependencies diagram shows titles and edge kinds. One direction rule everywhere (source to target, labelled), so the restart test''s two assertions moved with the format. Status colours are shared constants; TASK_DEPENDENCY_EDGES deleted with its only caller. 308 passed (coverage 71.4%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:27:18', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (223, 'task', 'TASK-0062-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed d9a1128 on roadmap/r13-diagrams (not pushed). Each type writes {type}-diagram.mmd/.md and overwrites it; a limit caps each kind and the response says what it cut; without a limit nothing is capped. directory_structure removed from the enum, the dispatch and the read-tool inventory. Budget moved in the same change: 23 tools / 12,580 chars (Export 1,095). 312 passed (coverage 71.4%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:31:35', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (224, 'task', 'TASK-0063-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 83f18d0 on roadmap/r13-diagrams (not pushed). README covers each diagram type, the one direction rule for edges, the limit and its reporting, stable filenames and the deprecated exclusion, with directory_structure removed from its lists; CLAUDE.md notes diagrams come from the stored links; CHANGELOG records the three breaking changes; tests/test_r13_acceptance.py covers REQ-0008-FUNC-00''s six criteria. Budget unchanged at 23 tools / 12,580 chars. CI command 318 passed (coverage 71.4%); default run incl. property tests 321 passed; lint clean; smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:36:43', 0);
