INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (232, 'task', 'TASK-0064-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 35f5545 on roadmap/r14-ergonomics (not pushed). REQ-12-FUNC, TASK-12, TASK-12-1 and ADR-4 resolve to stored IDs; resolution happens once in server routing so every tool takes aliases and no tool gained a parameter (budget unmoved). A complete stored ID is never treated as an alias, so handler "not found" messages, per-ID list results and empty query results are unchanged; unknown aliases are refused, ambiguous ones name the candidates. A first attempt did refuse full-but-missing IDs at the routing layer and broke 11 tests; the stored-ID passthrough rule fixed it. 323 passed (coverage 71.9%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:48:02', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (233, 'task', 'TASK-0065-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 2bc16d4 on roadmap/r14-ergonomics (not pushed). A task that something points at as its parent is counted through its subtasks, so a split task counts as its two leaves; migration 16 rebuilds the counter triggers and recomputes stored counters without touching status; two new triggers follow parent links. First attempt had the leaf test inverted (dropped subtasks, kept parents) and broke five tests. Two migration assertions moved with the corrected counting: the legacy fixture is the F-22 shape and now reads 1 leaf complete, and the migration 14 trigger check allows the new parent triggers. 327 passed (coverage 72.0%), lint clean, smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:53:38', 0);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id", "entity_type", "entity_id", "reviewer", "comment", "created_at", "resolved") VALUES (234, 'task', 'TASK-0066-00-00', 'MCP User', 'Committed 2bb47d9 on roadmap/r14-ergonomics (not pushed). README Short IDs section with the four forms and the unknown/ambiguous behaviour; CLAUDE.md records where resolution happens, the stored-ID passthrough rule and leaf-only progress; CHANGELOG lists aliases as added and the counter double count as fixed with migration 16. tests/test_r14_acceptance.py covers REQ-0001-NFUNC-00''s four criteria. Budget unchanged at 23 tools / 12,580 chars. CI command 331 passed (coverage 72.0%); default run incl. property tests 334 passed; lint clean; smoke 23 tools.', '2026-09-16 01:56:28', 0);
